Package: hmmExtraStatesRepro
Type: Project
Title: Reproducibility Materials for Extra Hidden States under Emission Misspecification
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: person("Aurelien", "Nicosia", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aurelien.nicosia@mat.ulaval.ca")
Description: Data, R code, fixed seeds, tests, and computational results for
    studying emission misspecification in hidden Markov models. Includes
    Gaussian and mixture-emission models, a genomic allelic-imbalance
    application, and supplementary movement analyses.
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    digest,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    moveHMM,
    patchwork,
    scales,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    renv,
    testthat
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
